<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">On Children’s Day, Teamwork visited Casa Hogar Esperanza Para Ti, an orphanage in Queretaro, Mexico, home to 29 children of various ages. Our team showed love and support, filling the children’s hearts with joy as part of the “Donando Sonrisas a Niñas y Niños” (Donating Smiles to Kids) initiative. The event featured pizza, gift distribution, games, and drone photo displays. Nine Teamwork employees visited the orphanage, while 20 others contributed their time, money, or gifts, ensuring each child received a special gift. We are thrilled to give back to our community and share our good fortune</p>
